le it lasts.\n\nAfter a devastating attack, Triss\u2019s legendary lounge\u2014once known for its eccentric menu of mysterious drinks\u2014is destroyed, forcing her to move into the hero\u2019s shelter. But survival is never easy: supplies vanish quickly, and every journey to replenish them turns into a dangerous adventure. Together, the survivors must reach the Preacher\u2019s refuge, raid stores for strange ingredients to fuel a salvaged still, and face neurozombies\u2014creatures not fully turned, but deadly with guns in hand.\n\nThis is just the beginning: ten chapters are planned, with new ones already in development. Players can expect fast-paced, explosive action with a wide arsenal of weapons, from small shooters to heavy firepower, and plenty of chaos along the way. In a world where odd concoctions are the last hope, every bullet and every sip counts.", "short_description": "A bizarre plague has turned the sober into zombies\u2014only those under peculiar brews survived. Join up to four players in a story-driven VR shooter with ten chaotic chapters, unique mechanics, and explosive action. Explore Triss\u2019s ruined lounge, raid for strange supplies, face neurozombies, and relax in a multiplayer hub with mini-games or PvP battles. Every mission brings new chaos, humor, and survival twists."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://4ilab.io/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://4ilab.io/terms", "publisher_name": "4 I LAB LTD", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://4ilab.io/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1008279844328894"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "r